  "description": "COFSIC crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C74 H66 Dy5 F12 O26 1+,C20 H16 Dy1 F12 O8 1-,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.522-3.571 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.02-100.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5(L)4(LH2)2(tfa)4][Dy(tfa)4]·2CH3OH.",
